  ID: sporouscave
  Logs:
  - 'mergle asked me to investigate the sporous cave and see if the rumored sorcerers
    are in there. they mentioned it was near the base of the great mold tree.  '
  - 'the sorcerers had produced twin jesters to birth more pollutants. I was able
    to destroy the operation before any leeches reached the surface. I should return
    to mergle now.  '
